  "content": "\n\n# 全新的沉浸式体验\n探索一个前所未有的全新世界。崩塌的洞穴、可互动的布娃娃系统、物品物理效果以及更多内容正等待着您！\n\n## 支持平台\nWindows、Linux 和 macOS（M1/M2 CPU 仅支持 Minecraft 1.20 及以上版本，其他版本需使用兼容模式：[教程](https://github.com/haubna/PhysicsMod/issues/461#issuecomment-1332775496)）！\n\n## 生物\n这是每位物理爱好者的最爱。原版 Minecraft 中的每种生物均支持布娃娃系统、碎裂效果以及方块化形态！\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/9db8953f7a2367bcf5bd19e4f68b0aeb06438c82.png\"  width=32% height=32%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/667961bfc9fa614075724d4966f6c17acf08ccf2.png\"  width=32% height=32%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/4531e5c8c20fead27724a931f0486c5e96f454a7.png\"  width=32% height=32%>\n<p> </p>\n\n## 方块\n让 Minecraft 世界中的方块彻底碎裂吧！\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/1a49126674872d23fc046d7e1b2cf5484b73cd05.png\"  width=24% height=24%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/e0fee15d31152a55b36e1af2d3e7b76135c5831d.png\"  width=24% height=24%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/2dd72d83263634e5053e9623b4f8617f4d06ca9e.png\"  width=24% height=24%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/588e41c68cbe07f94a408759206a11b7bda8f28c.png\"  width=24% height=24%>\n<p> </p>\n\n## 其他特性\n受够了物品悬浮在空中？来试试物品物理效果！重力？月球？火星？冥王星？地球？随你自由调整！想让电脑性能达到极限吗？看看在结构崩塌时会撑多久！\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/9f99e6279a8d86fe4d6e11fb0e375e9bdc6f76a9.png\"  width=32% height=32%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/ec00d84aa78e77b864434d8a92b9433f46ed9b80.png\"  width=32% height=32%>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xy8aRQKS/images/db4b525ede9c344b52a16b871234ceb433078ca3.png\"  width=32% height=32%>",
